cff-version: 1.2.0
message: 'To cite package "fmi2" in publications use:'
type: software
license: MIT
title: 'fmi2: Finnish Meteorological Institute Open Data API R Client'
version: 0.3.1.
abstract: R client for the Finnish Meteorological Institute (FMI) open data API. This
  package supersedes the obsolete fmi package. Client can be used to fetch geospatial
  over FMI's WFS <https://en.ilmatieteenlaitos.fi/open-data-manual-accessing-data>
  and converted into geospatial objects in R.
